name: Lucky Cat — lucky-trigger X-mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Lucky Cat gains X0.25 Mult every time a Lucky card successfully triggers. Lua
  `enhancement_gate` means real shops require a Lucky card in deck before it can appear;
  Motely can still search the raw first-shop slot. The Magician creates Lucky cards;
  Oops All 6s doubles Lucky trigger odds. RAG aliases: casino cat, lucky money, funny slots.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: LuckyCat
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - tarotCard: TheMagician
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
    label: "TheMagician (creates 2 Lucky cards — core enabler)"
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 20
